concept:national-disability-insurance-scheme-amendment-worker-screening-database-act-2019-sch-1-sec-10b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10B(2) Definition of NDIS worker screening law"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before determining a law of a State or Territory, the Minister must be satisfied that the law establishes a scheme for the screening of workers for purposes including the National Disability Insurance Scheme." ;
