doc:sch-1-sec-181y-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "181Y(2) NDIS worker screening database" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The NDIS worker screening database must be kept in electronic form. Purposes of the database" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

concept:national-disability-insurance-scheme-amendment-worker-screening-database-act-2019-sch-1-sec-181y-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "181Y(3) NDIS worker screening database"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-181y-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The purposes of the NDIS worker screening database are the following:  (a) to maintain, for the purposes of the National Disability Insurance Scheme, an up-to-date record of persons who, under decisions made under NDIS worker screening laws, have been found, in working, or seeking to work, with people with disability not to pose a risk, or to pose a risk, to such people;  (b) in relation to persons covered by paragraph (a)—to maintain an up-to-date record of other decisions that relate to the decisions covered by that paragraph;  (c) to share information in the database with persons or bodies (including employers and potential employers) for the purposes of the National Disability Insurance Scheme;  (d) any other purpose determined in an instrument under subsection (8)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The purposes of the NDIS worker screening database are the following:  (a) to maintain, for the purposes of the National Disability Insurance Scheme, an up-to-date record of persons who, under decisions made under NDIS worker screening laws, have been found, in working, or seeking to work, with people with disability not to pose a risk, or to pose a risk, to such people;  (b) in relation to persons covered by paragraph (a)—to maintain an up-to-date record of other decisions that relate to the decisions covered by that paragraph;  (c) to share information in the database with persons or bodies (including employers and potential employers) for the purposes of the National Disability Insurance Scheme;  (d) any other purpose determined in an instrument under subsection (8)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a54668940a40c0d8e4928b1d675ff2d3ee603f8b15d331d34a356741c0a44bb1" ;
    values:partOf concept:national-disability-insurance-scheme-amendment-worker-screening-database-act-2019-sch-1-sec-181y ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Maintain an up-to-date record of persons who have been found not to pose a risk to people with disability." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
